# windOS Zen — Fluxbox edition package list (Debian 13 "Trixie")
# Consumed by modules/03-fluxbox/install-fluxbox-edition.sh (apt-get install).
# One package name per line; "#" starts a comment. All names verified against
# Trixie: conky ships as conky-std, neofetch is GONE (use fastfetch),
# the volumeicon binary ships as volumeicon-alsa, nm-applet ships as
# network-manager-gnome.

# --- session core (the edition spec) ---
fluxbox
picom
nitrogen
feh
rofi
alacritty
pcmanfm
conky-std
arc-theme
papirus-icon-theme

# --- apps referenced by skel menu / keys / startup ---
firefox-esr
mousepad
viewnior
galculator
gparted
lxappearance
volumeicon-alsa
network-manager-gnome
policykit-1-gnome
xscreensaver
htop
scrot
alsa-utils
playerctl
brightnessctl
fastfetch
